    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "unburden myself? idk what that even means. it just feels like i'm rotting from the inside. every time i look in the mirror i just see someone who doesn't belong here. i don't think people like me actually deserve to just... move on like nothing happened. it feels like a crime just to exist after what i did.",
